  "description": "BIGNIU BG-S: A Fat-Tire Electric Bike for Mixed TerrainThe BIGNIU BG-S is an all-terrain fat-tire electric bike for riders who want one bike for city commuting and mixed-terrain riding. Its 20\" × 4.5\" fat tires, three riding modes, and detachable 15Ah battery support riding on pavement, gravel, mud, snow, and sand.Key Specifications\n\nBuilt for Commuting and AdventureThe BG-S’s 20\" × 4.5\" fat tires provide confident grip through mud, snow, gravel, and sand, while the front and rear fenders help keep you clean on wet or messy rides. Choose pure electric power, pedal assist, or traditional pedaling, and use the 7-speed gear system on hills and flat roads alike.The detachable 15Ah battery charges in 6–7 hours at home or at the office. Common QuestionsWho is the BG-S for?The BG-S is for riders who want an all-terrain fat-tire ebike for commuting, gravel roads, trails, mud, snow, and sand.What is the BG-S range?The listed range is 28+ miles in electric mode and 40+ miles with pedal assist.",
